        </p>

        <table class="data-table" style="width:100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="text-align: left; padding: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;">Tiền tệ</th>
                    <th style="text-align: right; padding: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;">Mua vào</th>
